# Keep development files out of the release archive.
#
# Omeka builds an addon zip with a plain `git archive`, so what belongs in the
# distribution is decided here rather than by whatever runs the build:
# https://omeka.org/s/docs/developer/register_an_addon/
#
# The first five entries are Omeka's own recommended list. The rest are this
# module's: the code style config, the translation notes and the test suite are
# for working on the module, not for running it. The compiled .mo files stay,
# since those are what the translator actually reads.

/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.tx/ export-ignore
/language/*.pot export-ignore
/language/*.po export-ignore
/.php-cs-fixer.dist.php export-ignore
/language/README.md export-ignore
/test/ export-ignore
